    "application": "BambuStudio-02.08.04.57",
    "profile_title": "0.2mm layer, 2 walls, 10% infill",
    "profile_notes": "An updated jumping frog print profile with added supports for cleaner prints, easy assembly, and a reduced weight of approximately 13 grams . Configured for a 0.4 mm nozzle, 0.20 mm layer height, 2 walls, and 10% gyroid infill . Both body pieces and two ribbed pegs are arranged on one plate. Feet: Added slim tree supports and mouse-ear brims to improve adhesion and prevent sagging or misshapen feet. Body: Added supports in the leg cutouts to prevent drooping overhangs and keep the openings clean. Assembly: Included ribbed pegs that securely lock the top and bottom together—no glue needed. Remove the supports and brims before assembly, then get hopping! The pictured frog was printed in rainbow filament for a fun, colorful finish.",
